[{"accession":"Q9H2U9","text":"Required for normal male fertility via maintenance of epithelial cell morphology in the caput epididymis and subsequently correct epididymis lumen structure required for sperm development (By similarity). Plays a role in sperm motility, flagella morphology and tyrosine phosphorylation during sperm capacitance (By similarity). Plays a role in normal expression levels of HSPA5, ITM2B and ADAM2 in sperm both prior to and post-capacitation (By similarity). This is a non catalytic metalloprotease-like protein (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}